{"id": 110, "name": "Valentina", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/1/12/Hero1101-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143333", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Finisher"], "difficulty": "80", "stats": ["50", "40", "40", "80"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Former head of House Paxley who'd stop at nothing to revive her lover.", "skills": [{"name": "Primal Force", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f2707973fdd30d201d53b1ff21d1a6c7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Valentina gains 8-50 extra EXP (scales with level) each time she deals damage to an enemy hero. Cooldown: 2s.\nIf the enemy hero's level is not higher than hers, 30% of the damage dealt is converted into her HP."}, {"name": "Shadow Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b94bb62631a5dafb525050bffb68de7e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Valentina casts <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Strike</span> in the target direction, dealing 475<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+145% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\nEnemy heroes hit are marked with a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Sigil</span> for 4s. Marked enemies hit by <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Strike</span> again are <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Terrified</span> for 1s (a target can only be terrified once every 4s)."}, {"name": "Arcane Shade", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_69e8d02ef8e1ae83895754e670f63e2e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "Valentina dashes in the target direction, firing 3 Shadow Bolts at nearby enemies that deal 90<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> each. She can cast this skill again within 6s (costs Mana).\n\nEach time a Shadow Bolt hits an enemy, the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Shadow Strike</span> is reduced by 1s."}, {"name": "I Am You", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ee7ae2c3b2074399fa3cdb5e5271630e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 55", "desc": "Valentina slows the target enemy hero by 70% for 0.5s and gains the ability to cast their <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate</span>. Casting the enemy's <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate</span> turns her into the enemy hero's form and inherits their Basic Attack type for up to 12s (her regular skills remain unchanged unless the enemy's <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate</span> has a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Morph</span> effect).\nThe stolen <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate</span>'s level equals Valentina's own <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Ultimate</span> level, and its cooldown is 120% of the target's (but no lower than 10s).\nIf the target is a Physical Damage hero, Valentina gains <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#fba51f\">Physical Attack</span> for the duration. This cannot be used on an enemy Valentina."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Magic Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_80a7900e7afd6a7f63384c781b043d33.png"}, {"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmw